            <span style="flex:1">How much does a home addition cost in Los Angeles?</span>
            <span class="faq-plus" style="flex:0 0 auto;font-family:Lato,sans-serif;font-size:22px;color:#7A3F96;transition:transform 200ms cubic-bezier(.25,.1,.25,1)">+</span>
