          <p style="margin:0;padding:0 44px 22px 2px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px">Costs depend on the project scope, the existing home, the property, required documents or approvals, and the decisions made as the project is defined. A free conversation is the appropriate first step for discussing your objective and next steps; it is not a substitute for a project-specific scope and written agreement.</p>
        </details>
        <details style="border-bottom:1px solid #B5BCC0">
